  "zh": "# 今日热点：汇源停产果汁、台风逼近、留学生旭日旗争议及国际示威演习引关注\n## 科技与产品\n- **汇源集团宣布停产汇源果汁**：标志着传统饮料巨头转型，引发行业对健康消费趋势的关注。\n- **iPhone Duo仅支持eSIM被劝退**：功能限制导致用户退货，暴露eSIM普及仍面临阻力。\n- **谷歌将TPU AI芯片送入太空**：首次在轨道运行AI加速器，预示空间计算新范式。\n## 社会民生\n- **超强台风“蔷琵”预计逼近我国**：可能带来强降雨和登陆风险，需提前做好防灾准备。\n- **央视曝光药企围猎老年人**：揭露保健品行业乱象，呼吁监管加强以防诈骗。\n## 国际视野\n- **欧洲多国爆发示威法国2000多人被捕**：反政府抗议升级，凸显欧洲社会矛盾与安全挑战。\n- **美日联合演习规模创历届最大**：展示印太地区军事合作加强，对地区格局有战略意义。",
  "en": "# Today's highlights: Huiyuan halts juice production, Typhoon approaching, Huiyuan students' flag controversy, and international protests & drills\n## Tech & Products\n- **Huiyuan Group announces halt of Huiyuan juice production**：Signals shift of traditional beverage giant, sparking attention to health‑consumption trends.\n- **iPhone Duo limited to eSIM draws backlash**：Function restriction triggers returns, exposing slow adoption of eSIM technology.\n- **Google launches TPU AI chip into space**：First orbital AI accelerator, hinting at new era of space‑based computing.\n## Society\n- **Super Typhoon “Hai‑Pi” nears China**：Brings heavy rain and landfall risk, urging early disaster preparedness.\n- **CCTV exposes pharmaceutical firms targeting seniors**：Reveals malpractice in health‑product market, calling for tighter regulation to prevent fraud.\n## International\n- **Europe sees mass protests, France arrests over 2000 demonstrators**：Anti‑government unrest highlights social tensions and security challenges across the continent.\n- **US‑Japan joint drill reaches historic scale**：Shows deepening Indo‑Pacific military cooperation, with strategic implications for regional balance."
